{"id":"Wb22b541e0dc267678ca8a6b9","zh":"城市轨道交通","en":"","name":"城市轨道交通","language":"zh","domain":"环境振动与轨道减振","concept_id":"Cab5e0c1fab030f6bb6fe","families":[],"definition_zh":"服务城市及相关区域交通需求的轨道交通系统。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":"在地铁上盖建筑的环境振动研究中，指作为振动来源的地铁运输系统，用于考察列车运行对上盖建筑振动的影响。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Wb22b541e0dc267678ca8a6b9","text":"城市轨道交通","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S2a8868eb4b8849a85103","source_id":"P133","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"synthesis; parameter combination analysis 地铁运营引起的环境振动问题严重影响城市居民的日常生活、危害地面建筑物寿命以及影响精密仪器设备的正常使用 [1],已成为城市轨道交通研究领域的热点问题 [2−6]。","citations":[{"source_id":"P133","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S5d1bf212fdf1597967d5","source_id":"P133","page":3,"page_end":3,"language":"zh","text":"在城市轨道交通环境振动的研究中,冯青松等 [22]将固定界面模态综合法应用于地铁车致建筑物的振动分析,并探究了 CMS 法在环境振动分析中的适用性、准确度与计算效率,同时研究了相关参数对建筑物振动的影响。","citations":[{"source_id":"P133","page":3,"page_end":3}]}],"sources":{"P133":{"id":"P133","title":"地铁上盖建筑车致环境振动预测模型及影响因素研究","authors":"张小安,王庞瑞,李姝婷,杨建近,徐磊,张晓芸","year":"2025","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20250090","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"张小安等（2025）","overview_slug":"2025-study-on-the-prediction-of-building-vibration-induced-by-subway-operation-and-influencing-factors"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"本研究中产生环境振动的地铁运输系统。","language":"zh","source_id":"P133","paper_slug":"2025-study-on-the-prediction-of-building-vibration-induced-by-subway-operation-and-influencing-factors","title":"地铁上盖建筑车致环境振动预测模型及影响因素研究","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"Wd8783974a3ee3f8ba0eb7545","name":"urban rail transit","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"Wd8783974a3ee3f8ba0eb7545","name":"urban rail transit","language":"en","k